      "writtenOn": "2017-12-07T10:40:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this class needs a docstring explaining how to use it. I find it a bit confusing that the class supports both explicit use (which starts when this object is constructed and ends when someone calls cleanupAndRelease or when its creator dies) and implicit use (which lasts for as long as the object is referenced), so that should be clearly explained here.",
