      "writtenOn": "2017-12-07T09:23:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is it safe to change mRefCount without locking? The methods that subtract from mRefCount all seem to lock on the IpSecService class lock, so it seems risky. If it is safe, can you add a comment to explain why?",
