      "writtenOn": "2017-12-07T10:40:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this name is confusing because the method may or may not clean up and release its resources. Perhaps \"unlink\" or \"unregister\", or \"delete\", since what this method really does is signal to the object that its caller is no longer interested in it?",
